            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20962 contributions\n1\nFish 🐠 soup\nAug 2026 • Solo\nThick fish soup, not so many street food like this one. Very probably long time here and having good reference with local community. Hidden in narrow street, all table under the roof to hide from sun or rain. Run by family business, recommended from friends\nWritten August 15, 2026",
